---
description: a mind map and a pie block side by side, styled with classDef and style
---
flowchart LR
  mermaid ideas["Ideas"] {
    mindmap
      root((Launch))
        Docs
        Demo
        Blog
  }
  mermaid share["Share"] {
    pie
      "Docs" : 40
      "Demo" : 35
      "Blog" : 25
  }
  ideas --> share
  classDef dashed stroke-dasharray:4
  class ideas dashed
  style share stroke:#2563eb
